  "ruleId": "d2p:schema-valid",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "title": "Documents are structurally valid",
  "description": "Every document is valid UTF-8 JSON without duplicate member names, has a known documentType and a compatible schemaVersion, and validates against its JSON Schema, including the schema-enforced conditional requirements. Expressions contain only the closed node list, every reference that leaves an aggregate is pinned to a revision, and every unit member uses a permitted unit.",
